o PAR 2026/559 Application deadline 2026-09-06 International student ambassadors with focus on Chinese social media - 2 vacancies Type of employment Fixed term Reference no PAR 2026/558 Application deadline 2026-09-06 Postdoctoral position to study lipid/membrane homeostasis in C. elegans Type of employment Fixed term Reference no PAR 2026/462 Application deadline 2026-09-04 Postdoctoral fellow in Political Science Type of employment Fixed term Reference no PAR 2026/497 Application deadline 2026-09-07 Cookie information Use of cookies At gu.se, we use cookies to make the website function as well as possible. By clicking on \"Accept all cookies,\" you agree to our storing cookies. Certain features require so-called third-party cookies. These are required, among other things, for embedded video and audio clips from YouTube and SoundCloud to be playable. If you choose \"Accept necessary cookies,\" we will not activate third-party cookies. Read more about cookies. Necessary Marketing Accept all cookies Accept necessary cookies Contact The University of Gothenburg Box 100 405 30 Gothenburg Sweden Main Switchboard +46 31-786 00 00 Visiting address Find organisation Organisation identity number: 202100-3153 Our channels facebook linkedin youtube instagram Shortcuts Student portal (External link) Staff Portal (External link) University library (External link) Work at the University Press and media EUTOPIA About the website Processing personal data Cookie settings Accessibility report"
